# Local scratch: `validation-assets/`

Anything that is not the plugin itself goes under repo-root `validation-assets/`. Create the directory if it is missing. Never commit it.

This includes: test dumps, batch-validation notes, screenshots, kubeconfig copies, project-list CSVs, cloned reference repos, and any other local-only artifact.

Do not put these at repo root, under `plugins/`, or in a tracked `validation/` folder.

**Not scratch** (must stay in git):

- `plugins/sealos/skills/use-sealos/references/` — skill docs loaded on demand
- Plugin manifests, `SKILL.md`, and `scripts/`

```text
❌ validation/results.md
❌ sealos-skills-old/
❌ railway-skills-ref/
❌ 开发阶段项目库.csv          # repo root

✅ validation-assets/results.md
✅ validation-assets/sealos-skills-old/
✅ validation-assets/project-list.csv
```
